WEBVTT

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.947
sio mabadiliko ya vurugu,

00:12:30.947 --> 00:12:32.678
na mabadiliko sana

00:12:32.678 --> 00:12:34.777
ambayo yanabadilisha

00:12:34.777 --> 00:12:37.093
maana halisi ya mapinduzi,

00:12:37.093 --> 00:12:39.650
kwa sababu mapinduzi ya kawaida ni yale

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.362
ambayo piramidi linageuzwa juu chini

00:12:42.362 --> 00:12:45.531
na wale walio chini wanakuwa juu

00:12:45.531 --> 00:12:47.690
na wa juu nao chini

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:50.159
yameahafanyika huko nyuma

00:12:50.159 --> 00:12:54.582
Tunachohitaji ni mtandao wa vikundi vidogo,

00:12:54.582 --> 00:12:57.828
vikundi vidogo na vidogo vinavyotambuana,

00:12:57.828 --> 00:13:00.114
vinavyokutana pamoja,